    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campus Legends College Basketball is the ultimate college basketball management game, putting you in control of your favorite team or allowing you to build a dynasty from the ground up. Featuring 192 teams (or up to 368 when using custom leagues) and thousands of players, you\u2019ll immerse yourself in the intricacies of coaching, recruiting, and team management to achieve basketball glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Top Talent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout and recruit high school and transfer players from across the country. Engage in recruiting battles and secure the future stars of your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up Your Coach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience points to enhance your coaching skills. Specialize in offense, defense, training, and recruiting to gain unique advantages and build your coaching legacy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comprehensive Stat Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track detailed statistics for every player and team. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >National Tournament</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a thrilling 64-team national tournament. Guide your team through the brackets, witness jaw-dropping upsets, and aim for the ultimate championship title. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Training</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your players throughout the season to fit your strategy. Manage your roster effectively to optimize performance. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Dynasty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a lasting legacy with your team. Achieve milestones, win championships, and establish your program as a powerhouse in college basketball.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campus Legends College Basketball is the ultimate college basketball management game, putting you in control of your favorite team or allowing you to build a dynasty from the ground up. Featuring 192 teams (or up to 368 when using custom leagues) and thousands of players, you\u2019ll immerse yourself in the intricacies of coaching, recruiting, and team management to achieve basketball glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Top Talent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout and recruit high school and transfer players from across the country. Engage in recruiting battles and secure the future stars of your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up Your Coach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience points to enhance your coaching skills. Specialize in offense, defense, training, and recruiting to gain unique advantages and build your coaching legacy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comprehensive Stat Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track detailed statistics for every player and team. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >National Tournament</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a thrilling 64-team national tournament. Guide your team through the brackets, witness jaw-dropping upsets, and aim for the ultimate championship title. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Training</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your players throughout the season to fit your strategy. Manage your roster effectively to optimize performance. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Dynasty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a lasting legacy with your team. Achieve milestones, win championships, and establish your program as a powerhouse in college basketball.</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the ultimate college basketball management game. Take charge as a coach, recruit top talent, develop your team, and compete for national championships. Manage one of 192 teams (or up to 364 when using custom leagues), making strategic decisions to build your basketball dynasty",
